{"speciesId":528,"names":{"fr":"Rhinolove","es":"Swoobat","en":"Swoobat","ja":"ココロモリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il émet des ondes sonores de différentes fréquences par le nez. Certaines peuvent briser des rochers."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It emits sound waves of various frequencies from its nose, including some powerful enough to destroy rocks."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le mâle courtise la femelle à l’aide d’ultrasons. Les écouter met de très bonne humeur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Anyone who comes into contact with the ultrasonic waves emitted by a courting male experiences a positive mood shift."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa queue s’agite frénétiquement quand il émet ses ultrasons assez puissants pour pulvériser du béton."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando emite ondas ultrasónicas, que incluso pueden reventar el cemento, agita su cola con vehemencia."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"コンクリートも 壊せるほどの 強い 超音波を 出すとき 尻尾が 激しく 震える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Le mâle courtise la femelle à l’aide d’ultrasons. Les écouter met de très bonne humeur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Todos rebosan de alborozo cuando perciben las ondas ultrasónicas emitidas por el macho para cortejar a la hembra."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Anyone who comes into contact with the ultrasonic waves emitted by a courting male experiences a positive mood shift."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"